<rss version="2.0" xmlns:atom="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom"><channel><title>some.pics (中文)</title><link>https://some.pics</link><description>只是网上的一些图片。</description><language>zh-CN</language><lastBuildDate>Sun, 04 Oct 2026 23:52:23 +0000</lastBuildDate><item><title>十月的徒步是最好的徒步</title><link>https://some.pics/6ac2e6b229489</link><description>&lt;p&gt;十月的徒步是最好的徒步&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img alt="Tall deciduous trees rise up as you gaze into a bright blue sky and watch their green foliage lit by the sun" height="3250" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" src="https://cdn.some.pics/annie/6ac2e6b229489.jpg" width="2437"/&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Shared by &lt;a href="https://annie.some.pics"&gt;@annie&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;</description><pubDate>Sun, 04 Oct 2026 23:52:23 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>你不需要稀有的工具来让你的魔法变得有意义。一把厨房的勺子就能将意念搅入茶中，一个罐子就能承载一个简单的护身符，而你自己的话语就能为你正在努力追求的目标命名。</title><link>https://some.pics/6ac2e487991cc</link><description>&lt;p&gt;你不需要稀有的工具来让你的魔法变得有意义。一把厨房的勺子就能将意念搅入茶中，一个罐子就能承载一个简单的护身符，而你自己的话语就能为你正在努力追求的目标命名。&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img alt="Square painted fantasy storybook illustration of a cozy moonlit stone-cottage kitchen with a candle, steaming tea cup, spoon, herb-and-thread jar, window with moonlit night, and golden emblem watermark at bottom-right. Text: Use what you already have. Hello Miz Jeannie watermark." height="1024" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" src="https://cdn.some.pics/hellomizjeannie/6ac2e487991cc.jpg" width="1024"/&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Shared by &lt;a href="https://hellomizjeannie.some.pics"&gt;@hellomizjeannie&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;</description><pubDate>Sun, 04 Oct 2026 23:43:06 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>Greta！

