📸：Greta 的人类&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img alt="A tiny black and brown dachshund puppy noses a small black and white dog after they'd been running joyfully playing chase." height="512" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" src="https://cdn.some.pics/jinx/6ac2dadf1a052.jpg" width="384"/&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Shared by &lt;a href="https://jinx.some.pics"&gt;@jinx&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;</description><pubDate>Sun, 04 Oct 2026 23:01:53 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>白昼之月</title><link>https://some.pics/6ac2c91e4519e</link><description>&lt;p&gt;白昼之月&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img alt="Green tree branches on the left under a clear blue sky with a small crescent moon." height="4284" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" src="https://cdn.some.pics/macmanx/6ac2c91e4519e.jpg" width="5712"/&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Shared by &lt;a href="https://macmanx.some.pics"&gt;@macmanx&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;</description><pubDate>Sun, 04 Oct 2026 21:46:10 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>搁在架子上的心</title><link>https://some.pics/6ac2c82acc3b7</link><description>&lt;p&gt;搁在架子上的心&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img alt="A cute and fluffy plush toy heart with a face on it sitting on a shelf " height="4032" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" src="https://cdn.some.pics/rrajath/6ac2c82acc3b7.jpg" width="2268"/&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Shared by &lt;a href="https://rrajath.some.pics"&gt;@rrajath&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;</description><pubDate>Sun, 04 Oct 2026 21:42:06 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>密苏里骡子正在享用一杯密苏里骡子。 https://tiltify.com/@rknightuk/stjude2026</title><link>https://some.pics/6ac2bf284ba33</link><description>&lt;p&gt;密苏里骡子正在享用一杯密苏里骡子。 https://tiltify.com/@rknightuk/stjude2026&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img alt="A fantastic handcrafted drawing of a Missouri mule (ie domestic equine hybrid) perched gracefully on a bar stool with a smoke in one hoof and the other hoof wrapped around the stem of a glass holding a Missouri mule (bourbon + apple brandy drink). The drawing sits atop an open envelope with a stamp and an airmail sticker." height="3024" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" src="https://cdn.some.pics/annie/6ac2bf284ba33.jpg" width="4032"/&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Shared by &lt;a href="https://annie.some.pics"&gt;@annie&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;</description><pubDate>Sun, 04 Oct 2026 21:03:40 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>这是我们第一次去 Bolingbrew Coffee Company 时拍的几张照片。咖啡很棒，我真的很喜欢那里温馨、放松的氛围。绝对是一个我愿意再去的地方。</title><link>https://some.pics/6ac2bae2463c3</link><description>&lt;p&gt;这是我们第一次去 Bolingbrew Coffee Company 时拍的几张照片。咖啡很棒，我真的很喜欢那里温馨、放松的氛围。绝对是一个我愿意再去的地方。&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img alt="A black-and-white sign for Bolingbrew Coffee Company, featuring a large vintage-style coffee cup and saucer surrounded by decorative lettering. The sign reads “Come for the coffee, stay for the charm,” with pointing hands on either side and five stars beneath the company name." height="2187" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" src="https://cdn.some.pics/dhester/6ac2bae2463c3.jpg" width="3280"/&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Shared by &lt;a href="https://dhester.some.pics"&gt;@dhester&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;</description><pubDate>Sun, 04 Oct 2026 20:45:26 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>这是我们第一次去 Bolingbrew Coffee Company 时拍的几张照片。咖啡很棒，我真的很喜欢那里温馨、放松的氛围。绝对是一个我愿意再去的地方。</title><link>https://some.pics/6ac2b9ff8bbd2</link><description>&lt;p&gt;这是我们第一次去 Bolingbrew Coffee Company 时拍的几张照片。咖啡很棒，我真的很喜欢那里温馨、放松的氛围。绝对是一个我愿意再去的地方。&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img alt="The interior of Bolingbrew Coffee Company, featuring a rustic wood-paneled counter and walls, vintage coffee memorabilia, chalkboard menus, and shelves stocked with coffee syrups and supplies. An espresso machine sits behind the counter, with pendant lights hanging overhead and branded T-shirts displayed on the back wall." height="3024" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" src="https://cdn.some.pics/dhester/6ac2b9ff8bbd2.jpg" width="4032"/&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Shared by &lt;a href="https://dhester.some.pics"&gt;@dhester&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;</description><pubDate>Sun, 04 Oct 2026 20:41:39 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>这是我们第一次去 Bolingbrew Coffee Company 时拍的几张照片。咖啡很棒，我真的很喜欢那里温馨、放松的氛围。绝对是一个我愿意再去的地方。</title><link>https://some.pics/6ac2b99f3938c</link><description>&lt;p&gt;这是我们第一次去 Bolingbrew Coffee Company 时拍的几张照片。咖啡很棒，我真的很喜欢那里温馨、放松的氛围。绝对是一个我愿意再去的地方。&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img alt="A cozy, rustic seating area inside a coffee shop, featuring wooden walls lined with shelves of vintage radios, clocks, glass bottles, and other nostalgic collectibles. A sign reading “These Are the Good Old Days” hangs above a wooden counter decorated with lamps, a framed photo of a dog, and Americana memorabilia. Black metal chairs sit along the counter." height="3024" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" src="https://cdn.some.pics/dhester/6ac2b99f3938c.jpg" width="4032"/&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Shared by &lt;a href="https://dhester.some.pics"&gt;@dhester&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;</description><pubDate>Sun, 04 Oct 2026 20:40:05 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>今天参观萨穆尼奥谷矿业生态博物馆时，可以看到许多关于工人们为改善劳动条件而斗争的提及与纪念。</title><link>https://some.pics/6ac2aff94ccaf</link><description>&lt;p&gt;今天参观萨穆尼奥谷矿业生态博物馆时，可以看到许多关于工人们为改善劳动条件而斗争的提及与纪念。&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img alt='Un cartel  en la pared de una ducha que dice "COMISIONES OBRERAS" junto a una pintada que dice "CONTRA EL PODER Y EL CAPITAL... ALIANZA SINDICAL' height="2452" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" src="https://cdn.some.pics/jsanz/6ac2aff94ccaf.jpg" width="3866"/&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Shared by &lt;a href="https://jsanz.some.pics"&gt;@jsanz&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;</description><pubDate>Sun, 04 Oct 2026 19:58:52 +0000</pubDate></item></channel></rss>